{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>根據 Apple 為 macOS 27.2 提供的企業版發佈說明，用戶升級至 macOS 27 後，系統不再移除已安裝的 Rosetta。此前的做法是，升級至 macOS 27 會一併刪除現有的 Rosetta 安裝。</p>\n<h2>Rosetta 通用支援至 macOS 27</h2>\n<p>Rosetta 是翻譯工具，讓以 Intel 為基礎的應用程式可以在 Apple 晶片 Mac 上運行。按照原有安排，升級過程會清除這項既有安裝，令依賴該工具的舊有應用程式失去運行途徑；企業版發佈說明所述的改動，正是針對這一點。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 仍是最後一個提供完整 Rosetta 支援的版本。Apple 計劃由 macOS 28 開始，逐步淘汰一般用途的支援。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 macOS 27 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/macos-golden-gate-02.webp\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/148830\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:20:55.474878+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:04:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:37.131698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:33.661710+00:00","content_hash":"624a35057f4700333196c4f58f151c493ceabf99eb35af25371ea14b3febb81d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}